P3para.Text:
in Part 3 of the Schedule, under the heading  “Consumer and business protection”, for  “Electromagnetic Compatibility Regulations 2006”, substitute “
                      Electromagnetic Compatibility Regulations 2016
                    ”;

in paragraph 19(7)(a), for  “the Electromagnetic Compatibility Regulations 2006 (S.I. 2006/3418)”, substitute “
                      the Electromagnetic Compatibility Regulations 2016 (S.I. 2016/1091)
                    ”;

P4para.Text:
in subsection (1), for  “unsafe” on each occasion that it appears, there were substituted “
                        non-compliant
                      ”;

in subsection (1), after  “any safety provision has been contravened in relation to any goods”, there were inserted “
                        or that any goods present a risk
                      ”;

in subsection (2)(b), after  “a safety provision has been contravened in relation to the goods”, there were inserted “
                        or that the goods present a risk
                      ”;

in subsection (1), after  “a contravention in relation to the goods of a safety provision” there were inserted “
                        or that the goods present a risk
                      ”;

in subsection (3), after  “a contravention in relation to the goods of a safety provision” there were inserted “
                        or that the goods present a risk
                      ”;

in subsection (1), after  “a contravention of a safety provision”, there were inserted “
                        or where the goods present a risk
                      ”;

in subsection (4)(a), after  “any contravention of any safety provision in relation to the goods” there were inserted “
                        or whether the goods present a risk
                      ”;

in subsection (4)(b), after  “any such contravention” there were inserted “
                        or whether the goods present a risk
                      ”;

in subsection (7), after  “a contravention of any safety provision”, there were inserted “
                        or prevent goods from presenting a risk
                      ”;

at the end of subsection (2)(a)(ii), for  “and”, there were substituted “
                        or
                      ”;

P3para.Text:
in section 31(1), for  “Part II of this Act”, there were substituted “
                    the Electromagnetic Compatibility Regulations 2016
                  ”;

in section 37(1), for  “Part II of this Act”, there were substituted “
                    the Electromagnetic Compatibility Regulations 2016
                  ”;
